{"id":205645,"name":"M9-4B-23, 2PS","headline":"Embellished 2BDR Penthouse @ Mangroovy |Free Pool & Beach","summary":"","description":{"Space":"\r\n\r\nThis  enriched 2 bedroom apartment is located in Gouna's only beachfront residence - Mangroovy with free pool and beach access. Mangroovy is closest to the Marina (10 min walk). \r\n\r\nThe 2 bedroom apartment comes with an open plan fully equipped kitchen, 2 full bathrooms with 1 ensuite and a living room, not to mention a beautiful balcony and a rooftop  to enjoy views of the pool and beach.  \r\n\r\nIt also features a 65 inch smart TV with Airplay and cable channels, washing machine, a Nespresso machine, kettle and a microwave. The apartment is great for couples & families. \r\n\r\nThe styling is made with a modish and calming taste to ensure guests have a wonderful and relaxing experience. \r\n\r\n\r\nAt Xuru Stays, we’re committed to providing our guests the magical hospitality they deserve.\r\n\r\n","Access":"\r\n\r\nGuests have access to the entire apartment\r\n\r\n","Interaction":"\r\n\r\nWe are more than happy to answer all of your questions. Guests can text and call anytime they need help and our team will be there in about 30 mins to solve any issue immediately.\r\n\r\nAt Xuru Stays, we’re committed to providing our guests the magical hospitality they deserve.\r\n\r\n","Neighborhood":"\r\n\r\n-Mangroovy residence is uniquely located 800 meters from Abu Tig Marina. Guests will be able to walk 10 minutes and get to it. \r\n-'Bright Star' supermarket is right in front of the residence towards the Marina.\r\n-Mangroovy is home to the famous 'Noi' beach lounge (located at Mangroovy's beach)\r\n- 'The Smokery', a local favorite is also located 450 meters from the residence.\r\n\r\n","Transit":"\r\n\r\nFree outdoor parking is available. \r\nTuktuks are available to take you anywhere in El Gouna.\r\n\r\n","Notes":"\r\n\r\nPlease note that smoking is not allowed inside the apartment. A fine of $100 may be imposed i