t":"2026-08-12T22:10:43.000000Z"},"reviews":[{"id":5022821,"review":"Nice place","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:53.000000Z"},{"id":5068107,"review":"wonderful apartments, helpful hosts, this is our second visit and we will be happy to come back again","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:57.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:57.000000Z"},{"id":5098911,"review":"Amazing !","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:59.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:21:59.000000Z"},{"id":5117044,"review":"خدمه مدار 24 ساعه ، موقع مميز ، مستوى النظافه عالي","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:01.000000Z"},{"id":5123553,"review":"Amazing apartment","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:01.000000Z"},{"id":5145978,"review":"Mycket bra lägenhet, och det var precis som i bilderna, jag skulle gärna boka igen","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:04.000000Z"},{"id":5188446,"review":"logement  très  bien,  et très  bien situé. \nla plage est à 200 mètres.  une piscine de dingue juste en bas et un super marché a 500 metres. seul  reproche,  la connexion internet est plus ou moins  aléatoire. Le logement manque d équipement pour la cuisine: pas de passoir, pas d épluche légumes,  pas de balais . de petite choses qui peuvent  facilement être  amélioré.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:10.000000Z"},{"id":5208744,"review":"Great view, very comfortable. The management is very helpful.  I would go back again any time.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:14.000000Z"},{"id":5236951,"review":"Très bel appartement, très bien placé pour la piscine, la plage et la proximité des centres de kité surf. L’appartement est très agréable et bien décoré. Il manque toutefois de matériel de cuisine.\nLes déplacements en tuk tuk permettent l’accès aux places animées et aux restaurants.\nXuru stays a répondu systématiquement à nos questions en quelques minutes!\nNous reviendrons !","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z"},{"id":5241702,"review":"The house was amazing. It was super clean and had everything you need. I would definitely recommend it. Host was helpful and was always replying if i wanted to ask about anything. Its always great to book with Air BNB. Till now zero disappointments specially when u pick wisely and read the reviews well.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z"},{"id":5242018,"review":"Emplacement parfait. Calme et confort. Proche tout. À 2 minutes de la mer, piscine magnifique et enfin très bonne communication.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:17.000000Z"},{"id":5248179,"review":"The apartment overall matched expectations. However, the pre-check in cleaning standard wasn’t up to par, with a used woman’s pink razor and a cigarette under the staircase. \n\nThe check in team also asked for our IDs which we provided, only to ask again (it was an automated message) asking us to fill up a poorly designed pre-check in form, only for us to be told after that it was not necessary. \n\nFinally we were provided with the wrong lock code on the door, and had to wait another 10 mins before being provided with the correct code,","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z"},{"id":5260920,"review":"Tout était parfait, l'appartement propre on arrive avant l'heure mais ils ont fait le nécessaire pour nous accueillir plutôt. \nVous serez pas déçu du séjour.\nMerci","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:20.000000Z"},{"id":5265795,"review":"تم ارسال رمز الدخول خاطئ مما سبب تأخير بالدخول ، ويوجد شعر على الكنب ، حمام مغبر والدرج يوجد به كبسولات قهوة على الارض مستخدمة ، لا يوجد انترنت \" واي فاي \" ، فقط قبل خروجي بساعة اتى شخص وقدم لي تشوكليت اعتذار وانه يريد اصلاح الواي فاي وانا وقتها خارج للمطار ..!!\nوصديقي ايضاً كان مستأجر من نفس الشركة وواجه نفس الاشكالية ولكن هو لم يستطيع الدخول ومما جعله ينام في شقتي مدة يوم .. لا اعتقد بأني سأكرر التجربة اذا لم يتم تعويضي بشيء مرضي على الاقل","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z"},{"id":5274531,"review":"Team was responsive and friendly accommodating all requests and inquiries.check in/out was very smooth.\nThe place was great, clean and exactly like the photos.\nThank you for professionalism of the whole team, definitely we will come again.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:22.000000Z"},{"id":5292077,"review":"They are a great staff and so friendly, helpful and responsive team, we had a great stay time.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:24.000000Z"},{"id":5324761,"review":"Perfect location and very responsive host","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:28.000000Z"},{"id":5334604,"review":"Le logement est très bien situé et de nombreuse activités sont a disposition (piscine, plage privée). La seule chose que je vous recommande de faire immédiatement c’est de très bien vérifier la propreté de l’appartement. Il n’était pas si propre que ça, nous avions eu beaucoup de surprise.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:29.000000Z"},{"id":5337783,"review":"5 star service and excellent unit will always book the same unit in the future.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:29.000000Z"},{"id":5422323,"review":"Very nice place to stay 🙂","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:42.000000Z"},{"id":5429680,"review":"Cool 👍🏻","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z"},{"id":5431496,"review":"Location is great for families that want quiet time and beach. recommend strongly. next time we come with friends. \nkitchen is not specifically well equipped. there are no basic spices, oil or a noodle sieve for making noodles. But all in all amazing apartment. \n\ncommunication is great but for a few misunderstandings that cleared up quickly. we come back next year.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:45.000000Z"},{"id":5442437,"review":"It was Amazing","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:47.000000Z"},{"id":5459431,"review":"Very communicative hosts and nice flat","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:49.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:49.000000Z"},{"id":5471524,"review":"Все прошло прошло отлично , жилье отличное , советую","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:51.000000Z"},{"id":5543650,"review":"Positive:\nDie Unterkunft war sehr gepflegt, entspricht genau den Bildern- die Lage ist auch super- direkte Strandlage👍 und das letzte Haus in der Anlage- dadurch einen fantastischen Ausblick aufs Meer hinaus von der Küche aus.\n\nNegative:\nDer Pool war leider zu kalt und er ist nicht beheizt.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z"},{"id":5571950,"review":"very nice and clean appartment, i likei t very much! i recommand it to anyone who wants a very cozy and great place to stay!","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z"},{"id":5571969,"review":"Positive:\nLovely apartment near zouni beach. Spacious and nice rooftop area for lounging\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:04.000000Z"},{"id":5578234,"review":"Excellent accommodation.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z"},{"id":5590319,"review":"Krásné místo,  čisté  ubytování,  výborný hostitel.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z"},{"id":5617357,"review":"overall, great experience. Location is great, host was extremely proactive. Highly recommend staying here!","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z"},{"id":5658327,"review":"Positive:\nIts was very clean and cozy\n\nNegative:\nNothing","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z"},{"id":5663269,"review":"I had a great time at this place, it was clean and comfortable and the host was very nice to deal with, I will definitely come back to this place","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z"},{"id":5664645,"review":"The house was not properly cleaned, smelled horrible, our bedrooms smelled like cigarettes, sticky doors, smelly toilets, kitchen cabinet smelled like trash, windows super un clean and tables stained! \nI communicated with Airbnb and our stay was only 2 nights, they advised they can send someone to clean, which is pointless as I will need to leave my vacation and stay with the cleaners just to fix their own issue!! Then they offered 10% on the next stay as a compensation, honestly would not trust them for another booking as how do I guarantee this wont happen again and they also offered 20$ 😂 so for us and our friend in the next room we take each 10$ and should be happy👌😅 and the person answering the messages starting making it sound like its my fault I am not accepting his genius solutions 👍\nNot recommended stay at all","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z"},{"id":5669417,"review":"Amazing place, responsive and cooperative host. Highly recommended.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z"},{"id":5714643,"review":"Amazing","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z"},{"id":5724028,"review":"The unit had a terrible smell coming from the kitchen sink, which was reported. Although they tried to fix it, unfortunately, the issue wasn't fully resolved. The fridge was not functioning properly at first but was fixed within an hour or so. The unit was clean and had easy access. Communication was excellent. Overall, it was an okay experience. \nthanks.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z"},{"id":5725413,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\n- no internet for 3 days despite many followups to recharge the credit card\n- local team never picks up the phone for any support\n- bathroom floor was very old and broken door hinges","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z"},{"id":5738908,"review":"Always perfect ❤️","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5739527,"review":"I recommend this property for those who need to relax and wants all facilities nearby ","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5751409,"review":"Mooie en schone woning. Goed gelegen vlakbij het strand en rustige omgeving. Wij waren tevreden.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5751699,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:29.000000Z"},{"id":5772833,"review":"Good, clean, safe, good community","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:32.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:32.000000Z"},{"id":5777047,"review":"the place was beautiful and clean with amazing sea view from every window in the apartment. everything was great and the host was very friendly and flexible... we are definitely planning a trip back there soon 🙏","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5800123,"review":"Had a great time and felt like home! \nVery responsive and if there is anything they sent the team to fix  immediately 👍🏻\nIt is also walkable distance from the best beach in Elgouna which makes it very convenient. \nWill definitely come again.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z"},{"id":5803389,"review":"I had a wonderful stay at this property! The house was exactly as described clean, comfortable, and well-equipped with everything I needed.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:39.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:39.000000Z"},{"id":5830305,"review":"Host was great, place was great","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z"},{"id":5846707,"review":"Positive:\nIts good but slightly far\n\nNegative:\nLocation","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z"},{"id":5880747,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z"},{"id":5894995,"review":"Very helpful and responsive team, excellent communication, and a clean place. Everything was amazing.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z"},{"id":5916793,"review":"Appartement de standing incroyable. Encore mieux que sur les photos, super environnement, piscine, plage privée. Résidence top, paisible et on s’y sent en sécurité nous avons passé une super semaine. merci à Xuru stays pour leur réactivité à n’importe qu’elle heure. Je reviendrais.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z"},{"id":5917707,"review":"Juste parfait","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z"},{"id":5923506,"review":"Satisfait de mon séjour passé dans ce bel appartement","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z"},{"id":5932446,"review":"Positive:\nToffe inrichting\n\nNegative:\nHelaas buren die aan het verbouwen waren","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z"},{"id":5936004,"review":"Eigentlich eine sehr schöne Wohnung mit guter Lage wenn sie Sauber gewesen wäre !!!","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z"},{"id":5942616,"review":"Positive:\nPrima locatie, dichtbij KBC.\n\nNegative:\nElektrisch slot in de voordeur is moeilijk te bedienen.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z"},{"id":5961109,"review":"مكان نظيف ومنطقة جميلة ومضيف رائع","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:13.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:13.000000Z"},{"id":6005126,"review":"Highly recommend. Closest complex to the beach. Rooftop entrance from within unit with views of pool and Sea. Everything clean and pristine. Door code to check in.  A++","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6034346,"review":"Great place to stay, loved every minute of it.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z"},{"id":6118944,"review":"مسكن رائع وجميل ونظافة ممتازة","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z"},{"id":6129968,"review":"This was our second stay with Xuru, and they were just as good hosts as the last time though their cleaning still needs some improving - but it was our first time in this particular unit and it needs significant attention from its owner, as the couch and chairs in the living room were stained, the dining table chairs were stained, and the home had an odor that we couldn’t get rid of despite our best efforts. Also, the drain in one of the bathroom-showers drained very slowly, when it wasn’t clogged, through our entire stay and the rooftop Terrace, which was a primary reason for our choosing this listing, had no real furniture except two worn down armchairs made of straw that was broken or torn. \n\nAs for the bedrooms they were comfortable enough, and the kitchen was well-appointed enough. \n\nThanks, Xuru. We look forward to staying with you at one of your other units in the future.","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z"},{"id":6157867,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:37.000000Z"},{"id":6161616,"review":"Excellent experience","rental_id":205645,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}